sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator
    participant B as Browser (SPA)
    participant E as Vercel Edge
    participant F as Vercel Function
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres
    participant ST as Supabase Storage

    Note over Op,ST: 1. LOGIN + LOAD ARCHIVE
    Op->>B: enter email + passphrase
    B->>F: POST /api/auth/login
    F-->>B: 200 OK
    B->>F: GET /api/assessments?operatorEmail=...
    F->>DB: SELECT past completed assessments
    DB-->>F: history list
    F-->>E: cache 60s · public
    E-->>B: history rendered in Scope

    Note over Op,ST: 2. RUN ASSESSMENT (with evidence)
    Op->>B: pick BU · start questionnaire
    Op->>B: answer Q1 · attach control-test.pdf
    B->>F: POST /api/evidence/upload-url
    F->>DB: verify operator owns assessment
    F->>ST: createSignedUploadUrl
    ST-->>F: signed URL + path
    F-->>B: { uploadUrl, path }
    B->>ST: PUT bytes to signed URL
    ST-->>B: 200 stored
    B->>B: save evidencePath in lifted draft

    Note over Op,ST: 3. FINALIZE
    Op->>B: complete 100/100 → "Compute & finalize"
    B->>F: POST /api/responses/create<br/>{ assessmentId, responses: 100 rows }
    F->>F: validate coverage · run computeVectors
    F->>DB: BEGIN tx<br/>UPSERT assessment<br/>DELETE+INSERT responses
    DB-->>F: committed
    F-->>B: { overallScore }

    Note over Op,ST: 4. LIVE BRIEF (Today)
    B->>F: GET /api/assessments/[id]/analysis
    F->>DB: SELECT responses + prior assessment<br/>(operator + status filter)
    DB-->>F: raw responses + prior pillar scores
    F->>F: computeVectors → computeAnalytics<br/>→ computeDrift → generateRoadmap<br/>→ computeRunSignatures
    F-->>E: cache private 30s
    E-->>B: { score, drift, roadmap,<br/>signatures.scoringInputHash }
    B-->>Op: Live Brief headline + sig chip + table

    Note over Op,ST: 5. EVIDENCE LIBRARY (download)
    Op->>B: open Evidence tab · click "Open ↗"
    B->>F: GET /api/evidence/download-url<br/>?assessmentId&questionId&operatorEmail
    F->>DB: JOIN assessments + responses<br/>verify operator owns it
    F->>ST: createSignedUrl (5min TTL)
    ST-->>F: short-lived signed URL
    F-->>B: { downloadUrl }
    B->>ST: GET signed URL (new tab)
    ST-->>Op: file streams to browser

    Note over Op,ST: 6. PDF EXPORT
    Op->>B: click "Report"
    B->>F: GET /api/assessments/[id]/pdf
    F->>DB: SELECT responses
    F->>F: pdf-lib · 5 pages<br/>cover with sig fingerprint
    F-->>B: application/pdf bytes (no-store)
